  "answer": "If the Payments Database goes down, the following services are affected: \n1. **Payment Service** - This service is critical for handling all financial transactions and requires the Payments Database for transaction storage (Payment Service --[DEPENDS_ON]--> Payments Database).\n2. **Fraud Detection Service** - This service performs real-time fraud detection for payment transactions and queries historical transactions from the Payments Database (Fraud Detection Service --[DEPENDS_ON]--> Payments Database).\n3. **Checkout Service** - While it primarily depends on the Order Database, it also interacts with the Payment Service, which in turn depends on the Payments Database (Checkout Service --[DEPENDS_ON]--> Payment Service).\n\nTherefore, the Payment Service and Fraud Detection Service are directly impacted, while the Checkout Service may experience issues indirectly due to its reliance on the Payment Service.",
